// Scalar parameters declared animation-capable for canonical built-in effects.
// Format: CHRONON_ANIM_PARAM(effect_id, params_type, member, minimum, maximum)
// The type and member expression are compile-checked by effect_param_animation.hpp.
// Do not add include guards: this file is expanded to build the whitelist and setter.
